Fixture for PORT-GIPS-J05. Every line below carries one prohibited construction.
This file is deliberately NOT scanned by the rule in normal operation -- its
suffix is `.fixture`, not `.md` -- and it exists so the rule's own test can
point the scanner at it and assert every phrase is caught.

If you are reading this because a real file tripped the rule: the fix is to
change the words, not to add a marker. See docs/gips-standard.md §9.3 for the
one approved form of words.

